I am expecting reasoning effort to be sent, and instead.. i get that. User's decision on max tokens is not even respected - it resulted in.. 1 token set as max.

FYI since Quick Open in VSCode can be activated with many different keys (eg. Ctrl+E or Ctrl+Shift+P & Backspace), one workaround is to just disable the Ctrl+P shortcut in terminals.

Add the following to `keybindings.json`:

```json
    {
        "key": "ctrl+p",
        "command": "workbench.action.quickOpen",
        "when": "!terminalFocus",
    },
    {
        "key": "ctrl+p",
        "command": "-workbench.action.quickOpen",
    },
```

